     1,
     "<div dir=\"auto\">Hi Paolo,<div><br></div><div>It’s a combination of prevalence and abundance filtering - in particular, MaAsLin retains features with &gt;0.01% relative abundance in at least 10% of the samples by default. Of course, you can tweak these parameters according to your need. Let me know if that answers your question. <div><br></div><div>Many thanks,</div><div>Himel </div><div></div></div></div>"
    ],
